# Local development only. Enable FLEXBUDDY_API_ENABLED and use a made-up local account.
# Supply password, token and challenge privately in the HTTP client's environment.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Password sign-in (never save the response or credential environment in Git)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{email}}","password":"{{password}}","deviceName":"Local test"}

### Complete a verification/two-factor challenge
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/code
Content-Type: application/json

{"challenge":"{{challenge}}","code":"{{code}}"}

### Resend an email code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/code/resend
Content-Type: application/json

{"challenge":"{{challenge}}"}

### Check the token's account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sign out this device
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/sign-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
